  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 3600.0,
      "e": 3603.6,
      "text": "<b>(wind blowing)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3603.6,
      "e": 3606.6,
      "text": "<b>(thunder rumbling)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3606.6,
      "e": 3609.27,
      "text": "<b>- Airborne science, we study</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3609.27,
      "e": 3610.4,
      "text": "<b>all kinds of different weather.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3610.7,
      "e": 3612.47,
      "text": "<b>Lightning is obviously a very big part.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3612.47,
      "e": 3614.93,
      "text": "<b>(dramatic music)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3614.93,
      "e": 3619.37,
      "text": "<b>- First name, Alistair, last name Ma.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3620.1,
      "e": 3621.67,
      "text": "<b>Engineering technician slash crew chief.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3622.2,
      "e": 3623.0,
      "text": "<b>It's very exciting to</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3623.0,
      "e": 3624.13,
      "text": "<b>be working with the ER2.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3624.43,
      "e": 3626.23,
      "text": "<b>My role is to design a flight campaign</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3626.77,
      "e": 3629.27,
      "text": "<b>that can put us over thunderstorms</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3629.8,
      "e": 3631.03,
      "text": "<b>as much as possible.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3632.67,
      "e": 3633.63,
      "text": "<b>(dramatic music)</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3633.63,
      "e": 3637.77,
      "text": "<b>- We gotta get as much as a nitrogen</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3638.0,
      "e": 3639.67,
      "text": "<b>out of this system as possible.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3640.37,
      "e": 3642.03,
      "text": "<b>- We are hunting for</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3642.03,
      "e": 3643.83,
      "text": "<b>gamma rays from thunderstorms</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3644.03,
      "e": 3646.13,
      "text": "<b>known as terrestrial gamma ray flashes.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3646.13,
      "e": 3646.77,
      "text": "<b>- So doing this</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3646.77,
      "e": 3648.27,
      "text": "<b>research helps us learn more</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3648.43,
      "e": 3649.9,
      "text": "<b>about how lightning forms</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3649.9,
      "e": 3651.63,
      "text": "<b>and reacts with mother nature.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3663.37,
      "e": 3669.27,
      "text": "<b>- We are hunting for</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3669.27,
      "e": 3671.07,
      "text": "<b>gamma rays from thunderstorms.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3671.47,
      "e": 3673.33,
      "text": "<b>These gamma rays can come in two forms.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3673.33,
      "e": 3676.03,
      "text": "<b>One are low energy, long</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3676.03,
      "e": 3677.67,
      "text": "<b>live things called glows,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3678.17,
      "e": 3679.13,
      "text": "<b>sort of enhancements in</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3679.13,
      "e": 3680.2,
      "text": "<b>the background radiation.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3680.67,
      "e": 3681.7,
      "text": "<b>And then within those</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3681.7,
      "e": 3683.93,
      "text": "<b>glows, you have things known</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3684.03,
      "e": 3687.5,
      "text": "<b>as terrestrial gamma ray flashes or TGFs.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3687.77,
      "e": 3688.67,
      "text": "<b>And they're very</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3688.67,
      "e": 3691.03,
      "text": "<b>powerful emissions of radiation</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3691.3,
      "e": 3692.17,
      "text": "<b>from thunderstorms.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3692.87,
      "e": 3695.83,
      "text": "<b>- In order to go and observe these TGFs,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3696.03,
      "e": 3697.67,
      "text": "<b>we are using the ER2 aircraft,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3697.93,
      "e": 3699.53,
      "text": "<b>which is a high altitude,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3699.73,
      "e": 3700.67,
      "text": "<b>high endurance aircraft.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3701.0,
      "e": 3701.87,
      "text": "<b>So it gives us the</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3701.87,
      "e": 3704.23,
      "text": "<b>ability to fly a distance away</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3704.53,
      "e": 3705.73,
      "text": "<b>and stay over those</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3705.73,
      "e": 3707.17,
      "text": "<b>targets of opportunity</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3707.47,
      "e": 3709.57,
      "text": "<b>for a good amount of time</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3709.57,
      "e": 3711.17,
      "text": "<b>so that we can make those observations.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3711.6,
      "e": 3712.87,
      "text": "<b>- One of the first things we're gonna do</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3712.87,
      "e": 3714.23,
      "text": "<b>when we come into work is</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3714.23,
      "e": 3715.23,
      "text": "<b>let the instrument teams</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3715.23,
      "e": 3716.03,
      "text": "<b>get about an hour.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3716.03,
      "e": 3716.47,
      "text": "<b>They're gonna go</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3716.47,
      "e": 3717.13,
      "text": "<b>through their instruments,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3717.33,
      "e": 3718.93,
      "text": "<b>make sure everything's working correctly,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3718.93,
      "e": 3720.17,
      "text": "<b>do their pre-flights along</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3720.17,
      "e": 3721.37,
      "text": "<b>with us doing our pre-flight.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3721.93,
      "e": 3723.33,
      "text": "<b>- So I-storm is an</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3723.33,
      "e": 3725.9,
      "text": "<b>instrument to detect gamma rays</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3725.9,
      "e": 3727.0,
      "text": "<b>from these energetic</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3727.0,
      "e": 3729.0,
      "text": "<b>events from thunderstorms.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3729.5,
      "e": 3731.27,
      "text": "<b>What we hope to find is</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3731.27,
      "e": 3732.57,
      "text": "<b>to understand the energy</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3733.17,
      "e": 3734.43,
      "text": "<b>of these photons and</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3734.43,
      "e": 3735.4,
      "text": "<b>that gives us insight</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3735.97,
      "e": 3738.07,
      "text": "<b>into the energetic processes that happen</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3738.73,
      "e": 3740.87,
      "text": "<b>in these gamma ray flashes.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3742.27,
      "e": 3745.47,
      "text": "<b>- Naturally when the dialing pressure,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3745.97,
      "e": 3746.93,
      "text": "<b>the head will go up</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3746.93,
      "e": 3748.83,
      "text": "<b>and we'll pull this down</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3749.73,
      "e": 3750.6,
      "text": "<b>or he'll pull it down</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3750.6,
      "e": 3751.5,
      "text": "<b>while he's in the aircraft</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3752.17,
      "e": 3753.33,
      "text": "<b>and it'll bring his head down.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3753.33,
      "e": 3754.6,
      "text": "<b>That way you can see in the cockpit.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3755.33,
      "e": 3757.67,
      "text": "<b>First of all, we pre-flight their suits</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3758.97,
      "e": 3760.37,
      "text": "<b>and make sure everything's good.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3760.63,
      "e": 3762.43,
      "text": "<b>All the leak rates are within tolerance.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3763.23,
      "e": 3764.63,
      "text": "<b>And then when the pilots</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3764.63,
      "e": 3766.23,
      "text": "<b>come down, we'll suit them up.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3766.6,
      "e": 3767.53,
      "text": "<b>And then he has to</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3767.53,
      "e": 3768.93,
      "text": "<b>pre-breathe 100% oxygen.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3769.5,
      "e": 3771.07,
      "text": "<b>We gotta get as much as the</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3771.07,
      "e": 3772.53,
      "text": "<b>nitrogen out of his system</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3773.03,
      "e": 3773.73,
      "text": "<b>as possible.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3773.87,
      "e": 3774.23,
      "text": "<b>- That's why it's</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3774.23,
      "e": 3777.13,
      "text": "<b>pre-breathing, 100% oxygen for an hour.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3777.67,
      "e": 3778.53,
      "text": "<b>They can develop the</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3778.53,
      "e": 3780.37,
      "text": "<b>bands if they go up too fast.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3781.53,
      "e": 3782.87,
      "text": "<b>Bubbles will fall in your veins.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3785.7,
      "e": 3787.13,
      "text": "<b>We're going to tow the aircraft outside.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3787.37,
      "e": 3788.67,
      "text": "<b>We obviously need fuel, which we bring</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3788.67,
      "e": 3789.77,
      "text": "<b>our own fuel tanks for.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3793.63,
      "e": 3795.67,
      "text": "<b>We'll fuel it and then after we've fueled</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3795.67,
      "e": 3796.43,
      "text": "<b>it, we'll take it</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3796.43,
      "e": 3797.37,
      "text": "<b>over to the launch spot.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3797.97,
      "e": 3800.73,
      "text": "<b>[ Sound Effects ]</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3801.43,
      "e": 3802.57,
      "text": "<b>After that we're going to get the</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3802.57,
      "e": 3803.57,
      "text": "<b>aircraft ready to go,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3803.57,
      "e": 3804.57,
      "text": "<b>get the pilot inside.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3805.9,
      "e": 3808.77,
      "text": "<b>[ Sound Effects ]</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3809.2,
      "e": 3809.97,
      "text": "<b>In addition we're</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3809.97,
      "e": 3811.47,
      "text": "<b>collecting validation data</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3811.53,
      "e": 3813.77,
      "text": "<b>for NASA lightning satellites, the</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3813.77,
      "e": 3814.8,
      "text": "<b>lightning imaging sensor</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3814.9,
      "e": 3817.43,
      "text": "<b>on the space station as well as the</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3817.43,
      "e": 3818.47,
      "text": "<b>geostationary lightning</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3818.47,
      "e": 3820.53,
      "text": "<b>mapper up on geostationary orbit.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3821.33,
      "e": 3823.1,
      "text": "<b>[ Music ]</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3824.4,
      "e": 3826.77,
      "text": "<b>With the success of being able to observe</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3826.77,
      "e": 3828.03,
      "text": "<b>TGFs on this mission,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3828.03,
      "e": 3829.97,
      "text": "<b>it'll be world known and the research</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3829.97,
      "e": 3831.37,
      "text": "<b>will help people globally.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 3832.6,
      "e": 3836.0,
      "text": "<b>[ Sound Effects ]</b>"
    }
  ],
